## Initial Q&A
### Is Hunter Biden, the son of US President Joe Biden, alive or deceased as of the current date?
Answer: Hunter Biden is alive as of the current date; the claim that he died in October 2020 was a false rumor originating from a 4chan hoax, with no evidence to support it.

Source URL: https://www.usatoday.com/story/news/factcheck/2020/10/27/fact-check-rumors-hunter-biden-dead-4-chan-hoax/3754066001/

